  "description": "SEO report and action plan inside the Umbraco 17 backoffice. Crawls your site and up to 5 competitors on a schedule, runs 38 SEO checks (indexing, technical, on-page, content), gives a health score, shows what changed since last time, compares you side by side with your competitors and builds a prioritised action plan with links straight to the pages in Umbraco. Free and works without any external service; optional AI (Claude and/or Jev by TypeSafe) explains the changes and makes the plan concrete, with a monthly USD cap. Dashboard UI in Danish.",
